'''Elun'aran''' is a ruined [[night elf]] city located on the isle of [[Tyrandas]]. At its center stands the [[Temple of Elunaris]], once a center for training for the priestesses of [[Elune]]. Once tended by druids who honored both the forest and the moon, it fell under the influence of [[Arch Druid Mothshroud]] and the [[Shadewalkers]], corrupting their purpose and twisting the land in rot.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|55+|The Rot of Elun'aran}}</ref><ref>{{questlong|Alliance|56+|Keeper of the Broken Grove}}</ref>

